{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"items\":[{\"id\":\"S01-r6-i2\",\"text\":\"波兰舞曲的步态渐渐浮现，像身体先记起怎样迈步；主题要到后来才站稳\"},{\"id\":\"S03-r2-i1\",\"text\":\"这里的和弦若突出，像重锤砸下；忽强忽弱、切分让心一悬，步乱，方向难定\"},{\"id\":\"S05-r4-i2\",\"text\":\"躁动和不安又加深；到这里，像几次深呼吸，紧绷短暂松开，却更像抵抗得累了\"},{\"id\":\"S06-r2-i1\",\"text\":\"接着忽入静谧，像玻璃罩、母亲耳畔轻哼的摇篮曲；温柔让人松戒备，却非现实变好，也不能久留\"},{\"id\":\"S06-r4-i1\",\"text\":\"后来，远方忽然亮起，梦里的家园看得见，却回不去\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4cd483d6-7424-4b25-86fe-2cdff3ba4cf6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T202927591293Z", "elapsed_seconds": 17.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T20:29:45.245241+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "07e6b9e958772a346fae0bdbe9b9b5adb1f3d9b3a41c65cea4dea7eea3da6fd3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734b